{
  "pages": [
    {
      "page_idx": 4,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "header",
          "bbox": [
            0.098,
            0.104,
            0.184,
            0.121
          ],
          "content": "STATISTICS"
        },
        {
          "type": "page_number",
          "bbox": [
            0.863,
            0.104,
            0.899,
            0.12
          ],
          "content": "175"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.096,
            0.138,
            0.901,
            0.179
          ],
          "content": "The third step is to find the product of $d _ { i }$ with the corresponding $f _ { i ^ { \\flat } }$ and take the sum of all the $f_{i}d_{i}^{\\prime} s .$ . The calculations are shown in Table 13.4."
        },
        {
          "type": "table",
          "bbox": [
            0.101,
            0.215,
            0.896,
            0.429
          ],
          "content": "| Class interval | Number of students (f<sub>i</sub>) | Class mark (x<sub>i</sub>) | d<sub>i</sub> = x<sub>i</sub> - 47.5 | f<sub>i</sub>d<sub>i</sub> |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| 10 - 25 | 2 | 17.5 | -30 | -60 |\n| 25 - 40 | 3 | 32.5 | -15 | -45 |\n| 40 - 55 | 7 | 47.5 | 0 | 0 |\n| 55 - 70 | 6 | 62.5 | 15 | 90 |\n| 70 - 85 | 6 | 77.5 | 30 | 180 |\n| 85 - 100 | 6 | 92.5 | 45 | 270 |\n| Total | Σf<sub>i</sub> = 30 |  |  | Σf<sub>i</sub>d<sub>i</sub> = 435 |",
          "captions": [
            {
              "bbox": [
                0.441,
                0.189,
                0.559,
                0.208
              ],
              "content": "Table 13.4"
            }
          ],
          "footnotes": [],
          "image_source": "images/page_4_table_4.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.148,
            0.454,
            0.723,
            0.499
          ],
          "content": "So, from Table 13.4, the mean of the deviations, $\\bar{d} = \\frac{\\Sigma f_{i}d_{i}}{\\Sigma f_{i}}$"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.148,
            0.512,
            0.609,
            0.531
          ],
          "content": "Now, let us find the relation between $\\overline { d }$ and $\\overline { { x } }$ ."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.098,
            0.532,
            0.9,
            0.58
          ],
          "content": "Since in obtaining $d _ { i ^ { * } }$ we subtracted $^ { \\circ } a ^ { \\prime }$ from each $x _ { i ^ { \\flat } }$ so, in order to get the mean x , we need to add $^ { \\circ } a ^ { \\prime }$ to $\\overline { d }$ . This can be explained mathematically as:"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.148,
            0.605,
            0.344,
            0.625
          ],
          "content": "Mean of deviations,"
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "bbox": [
            0.435,
            0.591,
            0.55,
            0.638
          ],
          "content": "\\frac{\\Sigma f_{i}}{\\Sigma f_{i}}",
          "image_source": "images/page_4_equation_9.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.153,
            0.659,
            0.193,
            0.678
          ],
          "content": "So,"
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "bbox": [
            0.436,
            0.644,
            0.617,
            0.813
          ],
          "content": "\\begin{aligned}\\overline{\\overline{d}} &= \\frac{\\Sigma f_{i}\\left( x_{i} - a \\right)}{\\Sigma f_{i}} \\\\&= \\frac{\\Sigma f_{i}x_{i}}{\\Sigma f_{i}} - \\frac{\\Sigma f_{i}a}{\\Sigma f_{i}} \\\\&= \\overline{x} - a\\frac{\\Sigma f_{i}}{\\Sigma f_{i}} \\\\&= \\overline{x} - a\\end{aligned}",
          "image_source": "images/page_4_equation_11.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.098,
            0.824,
            0.135,
            0.843
          ],
          "content": "So,"
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "bbox": [
            0.439,
            0.817,
            0.554,
            0.843
          ],
          "content": "\\left[ \\overline { { x } }   =   a + \\dot { \\overline { { d } } } \\right]",
          "image_source": "images/page_4_equation_13.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.098,
            0.866,
            0.139,
            0.884
          ],
          "content": "i.e.,"
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "bbox": [
            0.439,
            0.851,
            0.588,
            0.896
          ],
          "content": "\\left\\{ \\overline { { x } } \\; = \\; a + \\frac { \\Sigma f _ { i } d _ { i } } { \\Sigma f _ { i } } \\right.",
          "image_source": "images/page_4_equation_15.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "footer",
          "bbox": [
            0.435,
            0.967,
            0.564,
            0.982
          ],
          "content": "Reprint 2026-27"
        }
      ]
    }
